# Two doors that are never both passable. A switch chooses which side is.
# d0: inner door. d1: outer door. d2: an IC Switch or a signal switch.
# A locked door lets nobody through; an unlocked one opens for whoever walks up.
alias inner d0
alias outer d1
alias lever d2
loop:
l r0 lever Setting
beqz r0 goIn
# Outer side wanted: lock the inner door, wait until it has shut, free the outer.
s inner Lock 1
l r1 inner OpenNow
bnez r1 wait
s outer Lock 0
j wait
goIn:
s outer Lock 1
l r1 outer OpenNow
bnez r1 wait
s inner Lock 0
wait:
yield
j loop
